{"type":"text","timestamp":"2026-09-21T11:06:31.536Z","data":{"text":"Task 5 is complete. Here's a summary of what was done:\n\n## Implementation\n\n**`src/core/report.ts`** — Extended the post-034 `MetricsReport` with two blocks:\n\n- **`planning`**: Aggregates correlated `.run/plan.jsonl` sessions across active and archived changes using the task-1 `readPlanningSessions` correlator. Counts every valid start once, sums wall time only from matched exits (plus `wallSecondsByChange`), sums each finite usage field independently, treats observed zero as reported, and computes `reportedSessions`/`totalSessions` coverage. Cost stays separate and `harness-reported`.\n- **`cycle`**: One sorted JSON row per archived folder (`change`, `briefToApprovalSeconds`, `approvalToFirstTaskSeconds`, `firstTaskToArchiveSeconds`, `totalSeconds`), derived only from brief frontmatter date, manifest `approvedAt`, the earliest `started` in numeric task streams, and the `archived` event in `change.jsonl`. Missing/invalid/reversed/active/legacy data stays null/excluded. Phase aggregates expose `totalSeconds`, `averageSeconds`, `coveredChanges`, `totalChanges`.\n- Excluded `change.jsonl` from the legacy execution-duration scan so archive events no longer inflate durations.\n- Text output adds `Planning:` (with the exact `n of m sessions reported usage` phrase) and `Cycle:` (aggregate-only lines with `n of m archived changes`).\n\n**`src/cli/report.ts`** — `toStableMetrics` now projects `planning` and `cycle` into stable JSON.\n\n**Tests + fixture** — Added `report-planning.test.ts`, `report-cycle.test.ts`, `planning-integration.test.ts`; updated `report-json.test.ts` with new key/shape assertions and a byte-for-byte fixture comparison. Extended the fixture with brief/manifest/archive/plan artifacts (including an AGY all-null session and an observed-zero session) and regenerated `expected.json`.\n\n## Verification\n\n- Task verify: **25/25 pass, exit 0**\n- `pnpm verify`: **exit 0**\n- Built CLI fixture diff: **no diff**\n- Full top-level suite: only the 2 known pre-existing `delta-merge.test.ts` failures (unrelated cli-foundation ownership glob)\n\nResult written to `openspec/changes/035-planning-telemetry-and-cycle-time/.run/results/5.md`."}}
